<title>FRANCE: EU grain panel did not discuss exports.</title>
<headline>EU grain panel did not discuss exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee held no discussions on 1997/98 grain exports at Thursday's weekly talks in Brussels, member country officials said.  </p>
<p>Speaking before the weekly session, officials had said they did not expect the European Commission to unblock its stalled export tender process for grains until after the next EU farm ministers' talks scheduled for Monday and Tuesday.</p>
<p>Thursday's closed afternoon session did not see the subject raised, officials said afterwards.</p>
<p>&quot;There was no discussion,&quot; said one official.</p>
</text>
